$ bimcraft-cli run --cmd 'storm_size {"area": 50}'
[exit 1]
--- stdout

--- stderr
line 1 (storm_size): storm_size: `kind` (downpipe or horizontal) is required

$ bimcraft-cli run --cmd 'storm_size {"kind": "vertical", "area": 50}'
[exit 1]
--- stdout

--- stderr
line 1 (storm_size): storm_size: `kind` must be one of downpipe, horizontal, got "vertical"

$ bimcraft-cli run --cmd 'storm_size {"kind": "downpipe", "flow": 20000, "gutter": 50, "length": 2000}'
[exit 1]
--- stdout

