line 1 (storm_size): storm_size: more than 150 mm inside is off the abacuses of NBR 10844's Figure 3

$ bimcraft-cli run --cmd 'storm_size {"kind": "downpipe", "flow": 200, "gutter": 40, "length": 2000}'
[exit 1]
--- stdout

--- stderr
line 1 (storm_size): storm_size: the water depth in the gutter must be 50 to 100 mm: the abacuses stop there

