[exit 1]
--- stdout

--- stderr
line 1 (storm_size): storm_size: a downpipe shorter than 0.3 m is off the abacuses

$ bimcraft-cli run --cmd 'storm_size {"kind": "downpipe", "flow": 200, "length": 2000}'
[exit 1]
--- stdout

--- stderr
line 1 (storm_size): storm_size: `gutter` (the water depth in the gutter, 50 to 100 mm) is required

$ bimcraft-cli run --cmd 'storm_size {"kind": "downpipe", "flow": 200, "gutter": 60}'
[exit 1]
--- stdout

--- stderr
line 1 (storm_size): storm_size: `length` (the downpipe's, mm) is required

